      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استظأرت</span></b>  <i>She</i> (a bitch) <i>desired the male:</i>
(K:) mentioned by AM; but he says, “ I hesitate respecting it. ” (TA.) [I think it is probably
a mistake for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استطارت</span>, mentioned in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طير</span>.
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظُؤْرَى</span>.]

